    [   0] m "Hey, have you ever heard of the term 'yandere'?"
    [   1] m "It's a personality type that means someone is so obsessed with you that they'll do absolutely anything to be with you."
    [   2] m "Usually to the point of craziness..."
    [   3] m "They might stalk you to make sure you don't spend time with anyone else."
    [   4] m "They might even hurt you or your friends to get their way..."
    [   5] m "But anyway, this game happens to have someone who can basically be described as yandere."
    [   6] m "By now, it's pretty obvious who I'm talking about."
    [   7] m "And that would be..."
    [   8] m "Yuri!"
    [   9] m "She really got insanely possessive of you, once she started to open up a little."
    [  10] m "She even told me I should kill myself."
    [  11] m "I couldn't even believe she said that - I just had to leave at that point."
    [  12] m "But thinking about it now, it was a little ironic. Ahaha!"
    [  13] m "Anyway..."
    [  14] m "A lot of people are actually into the yandere type, you know?"
    [  15] m "I guess they really like the idea of someone being crazy obsessed with them."
    [  16] m "People are weird! I don't judge, though!"
    [  17] m "Also, I might be a little obsessed with you, but I'm far from crazy..."
    [  18] m "It's kind of the opposite, actually."
    [  19] m "I turned out to be the only normal girl in this game."
    [  20] m "It's not like I could ever actually kill a person..."
    [  21] m "Just the thought of it makes me shiver."
    [  22] m "But come on...everyone's killed people in games before."
    [  23] m "Does that make you a psychopath? Of course not."
    [  24] m "But if you do happen to be into the yandere type..."
    [  25] m "I can try acting a little more creepy for you. Ehehe~"
    [  26] m "Then again..."
    [  27] m "There's already nowhere else for you to go, or anyone for me to get jealous over."
    [  28] m "Is this a yandere girl's dream?"
    [  29] m "I'd ask Yuri if I could."
